OL,3,GNEWSAFlood defence project to finish
OL,4,Aahead of schedule
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork on a long-awaited Worcestershire
OL,7,Fflood defence scheme is on track to be
OL,8,Fcompleted two months earlier than
OL,9,Fexpected, because of the dry weather.
OL,11,FThe Environment Agency said it expects
OL,12,Fthe measures in Severn Stoke to be in
OL,13,Fplace by mid-October instead of by the
OL,14,Fend of the year.
OL,16,FUnder the #5.2m project a special clay
OL,17,Fembankment is being created to the west
OL,18,Fof the village off the A38, while a
OL,19,Fsection of Ham Lane will be raised.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
