OL,3,GNEWSAFlood defence project to finish
OL,4,Aahead of schedule
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharlie Chandler, area flood risk
OL,7,Fmanager, said: "We've had a really good
OL,8,Fsummer in terms of it being dry so
OL,9,Fwe've been able to pull everything
OL,10,Fforward, which is great."
